{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>And you shall keep all My statutes and all My ordinances.</b> Examine them and recognize that they are fitting." "<b>And you shall do them.</b> And in this manner you shall do them." "<b>I am HaShem.</b> He explains that all observance of the statutes and ordinances should be without addition and without diminution, for indeed the deeds of HaShem and His commandments are at the utmost perfection, to which nothing may be added and from which nothing may be diminished."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:01.794541995Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}